Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1100
Set Height 640
Set Padding 12
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Hide
Type "export PS1='$ '; $DEMO_DIR/seed-diaryctl.sh; clear"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Show
Type "diaryctl"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Down
Sleep 800ms
Down
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
Escape
Sleep 700ms
Type "q"
Sleep 500ms
